# 🚀 Portfolium 3D

A modern and interactive 3D portfolio built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, using Swiper.js for smooth navigation and dynamic UI effects.

---

## 🌐 Live Demo
👉 https://<usuario>.github.io/<nombre-repo>/

---

## ✨ Features

- 🎴 3D Swiper navigation
- 🌙 Dark / Light mode toggle
- 📱 Fully responsive design
- 🎨 Modern UI with animations
- 🧠 Clean and scalable architecture
- 📂 Project filtering system

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3 (BEM methodology)
- JavaScript (Vanilla)
- Swiper.js
- DevIcons

